 crash←tno RemoveUnsavableVars crash;names;name;removed
⍝ Removes from `crash.Vars` every variable that cannot be written to a component file, and lists their
⍝ names in `crash.VarsNotSaved`.\\
⍝ `tno` is the tie number of the component file `crash` is going to be saved in; see `CanBeSaved`.\\
⍝ Returns `crash`.
 removed←0⍴⊂''
 :If 9=crash.⎕NC'Vars'
     names←' '~¨⍨↓crash.Vars.⎕NL 2
     :For name :In names
         :If ~tno CanBeSaved crash.Vars⍎name
             removed,←⊂name
             crash.Vars.⎕EX name
         :EndIf
     :EndFor
 :EndIf
 crash.VarsNotSaved←removed
